            "reviewBody": "This recipe caught my eye because we love all of the ingredients! The pizza had great color and eye appeal and the flavor was good - next time I think I would add some spices to give it more kick - maybe some garlic and italian herbs. Also, my sundried tomatoes were quite crispy, not sure why they were charred! Nonetheless, this was a very good recipe and I will probably make it again, albeit with a few tweaks.",
